            "col_dk": "6",
            "col_tb": "6",
            "text_size": "30,15",
            "txt_align": "start",
            "sub_heading": "Lukáš Klimpera",
            "heading": "“Don’t make compromises when it comes to health and comfort”",
            "text": "<p>Shoes shouldn’t be healthy or stylish. You can have both. <\/p><p>Our barefoot and Comfort shoes are designed around the <strong>natural shape of the foot<\/strong>. They’re also based on research and <strong>my practice as a physiotherapist<\/strong>. That’s why I know you’ll feel good in them the first time you put them on.<\/p>",
            "subhd_color": "#202020",
            "hd_color": "#202020",
            "des_color": "#202020",
            "use_shadow": false,
            "button_label": "More about Ahinsa",
            "button_link": "shopify:\/\/pages\/nas-pribeh",
            "open_link": "_self",
            "btn_icon": false,
            "button_style": "default",
